<title>USA: Ursinus College, Pa. repriced, yields 6.10 in 2027.</title>
<headline>Ursinus College, Pa. repriced, yields 6.10 in 2027.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Education Securities Inc said it repriced a Pennsylvania Higher Education Facilities Authority issue for Ursinus College, lowering the yield in 2027 to 6.10 percent from 6.125 percent, and the coupon to 5.90 percent from 5.95 percent.</p>
<p>Pennsylvania Higher Education</p>
<p>RE: $15,295,000*</p>
<p>Facilities Authority</p>
<p>Series of 1997</p>
<p>(Ursinus College)</p>
<p>THE ACCOUNT IS CLOSED.</p>
<p>MOODY'S: NR		    S&amp;P: BBB+</p>
<p>DATED: 02/01/1997	  FIRST COUPON: 07/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 01/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>01/01/2000		   35M    5.00  %	  4.75</p>
<p>					(Approx. $ Price 100.656)</p>
