<p>					(Approx. $ Price 97.257)</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 01/01/2007 at 102.00, DTP 01/01/2009.</p>
<p>The award is expected Wednesday, February 5, 1997.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on February 19, 1997.</p>
<p>Education Securities</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
